                "value": "<div class=\"fn\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;\">De triomf van de Doods</div><br><i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Triumph_of_Death\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:The Triumph of Death\">The Triumph of Death</a></i></div>",
